			<p>Have a question, a song request, or just want to say hello? We'd love to hear from you.</p>

			<h2>Email</h2>
			<p>Reach us at <a href="mailto:dineshpayal91@gmail.com" class="content-link">dineshpayal91@gmail.com</a></p>

			<h2>Social</h2>
			<p>Follow us for updates, new playlists, and behind-the-scenes moments from the wedding radio world.</p>

			<h2>Feedback</h2>
			<p>Your suggestions help us keep the dhol beating. Let us know what tracks you want to hear next, or if something isn't working right.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
